  "id": "sql-132",
  "title": "Quiz about SQL",
  "content": "<div id=\"__next\" data-reactroot=\"\"><div style=\"visibility:hidden;background-color:#ffffff;min-height:100vh\"><div data-overlay-container=\"true\"><style>\n      #nprogress {\n        pointer-events: none;\n      }\n      #nprogress .bar {\n        background: #29D;\n        position: fixed;\n        z-index: 9999;\n        top: 0;\n        left: 0;\n        width: 100%;\n        height: 3px;\n      }\n      #nprogress .peg {\n        display: block;\n        position: absolute;\n        right: 0px;\n        width: 100px;\n        height: 100%;\n        box-shadow: 0 0 10px #29D, 0 0 5px #29D;\n        opacity: 1;\n        -webkit-transform: rotate(3deg) translate(0px, -4px);\n        -ms-transform: rotate(3deg) translate(0px, -4px);\n        transform: rotate(3deg) translate(0px, -4px);\n      }\n      #nprogress .spinner {\n        display: block;\n        position: fixed;\n        z-index: 1031;\n        top: 15px;\n        right: 15px;\n      }\n      #nprogress .spinner-icon {\n        width: 18px;\n        height: 18px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        border: solid 2px transparent;\n        border-top-color: #29D;\n        border-left-color: #29D;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        -webkit-animation: nprogresss-spinner 400ms linear infinite;\n        animation: nprogress-spinner 400ms linear infinite;\n      }\n      .nprogress-custom-parent {\n        overflow: hidden;\n        position: relative;\n      }\n      .nprogress-custom-parent #nprogress .spinner,\n      .nprogress-custom-parent #nprogress .bar {\n        position: absolute;\n      }\n      @-webkit-keyframes nprogress-spinner {\n        0% {\n          -webkit-transform: rotate(0deg);\n        }\n        100% {\n          -webkit-transform: rotate(360deg);\n        }\n      }\n      @keyframes nprogress-spinner {\n        0% {\n          transform: rotate(0deg);\n        }\n        100% {\n          transform: rotate(360deg);\n        }\n      }\n    </style><div class=\"root\" id=\"data-mode\" data-dark-mode=\"false\" style=\"display:block\"><div id=\"comp\"><div style=\"display:block;position:sticky;top:0px;z-index:1000\"><div class=\"root gfg_header__root\" style=\"display:none\"><div id=\"comp\"><div class=\"gfgheader_parentContainer\"><div class=\"containerWrapper \" id=\"topMainHeader\"><div class=\"headerContainer\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:304px\"><a class=\"headerMainLogo\" href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-710\"><div class=\"logo\"><img class=\"gfgLogoImg normal\" src=\"./images/sql-132-img-1.svg\" alt=\"geeksforgeeks\" width=\"48\" height=\"24\"></div></a><div class=\"gs-plus-suggestion-container\"><div class=\"gs-input_wrapper\"><span class=\"flexR gs-toggle-icon\"><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-2.svg\" width=\"32px\" height=\"32px\" alt=\"search icon\"></span></div></div></div><ul class=\"headerMainList\"><li class=\"headerMainListItem\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center\" class=\"genericHeaderListClass\"><div style=\"display:inline\">Courses<div></div></div><i class=\"gfg-icon   gfg-icon-black-down-carrot genericHeaderListClass\" style=\"position:relative;left:2px;top:0px\"></i></span></li><li class=\"headerMainListItem\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center\" class=\"genericHeaderListClass\"><div style=\"display:inline\">Tutorials<div></div></div><i class=\"gfg-icon   gfg-icon-black-down-carrot genericHeaderListClass\" style=\"position:relative;left:2px;top:0px\"></i></span></li><li class=\"headerMainListItem\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center\" class=\"genericHeaderListClass\"><div style=\"display:inline\">Interview Prep<div></div></div><i class=\"gfg-icon   gfg-icon-black-down-carrot genericHeaderListClass\" style=\"position:relative;left:2px;top:0px\"></i></span></li></ul><div class=\"header-main__container\" style=\"display:flex;width:auto;align-items:center\"><div style=\"width:100px;margin-right:20px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin:0 6px;gap:6px\"><div class=\"darkMode-wrap darkMode-wrap-desktop\" data-mode=\"Switch to Dark Mode\"><button data-gfg-action=\"toggleGFGTheme\" aria-label=\"Toggle GFG Theme\"><div class=\"darkMode-wrap-red-dot\"></div><i class=\"gfg-icon gfg-icon_dark-mode\"></i></button><span class=\"darkModeTooltipText\"></span></div></div><div style=\"min-width:73px\"><div style=\"height:36px\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"script\"></div></div><div class=\"gfg_header__root\" data-dark-mode=\"false\"><div class=\"outisdeMainContainerSubheader \" style=\"background-color:white\"><div class=\"mainContainerSubheader \" id=\"secondarySubHeader\"><ul class=\"containerSubheader\" style=\"background-color:white;justify-content:center\"><li><a href=\"#/article/distributed-systems/distributed-systems-105\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">DSA</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-893\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Practice Problems</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-1802\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">C </a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-1803\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">C++</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-1804\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Java</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/web-dev/web-dev-010\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Python</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/web-dev/web-dev-006\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">JavaScript</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-1805\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Data Science</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-1806\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Machine Learning</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/dsa/dsa-1778\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Courses</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/devops/devops-004\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">Linux</a></li><li><a href=\"#/article/distributed-systems/distributed-systems-110\" class=\"link\" style=\"color:#273239\">DevOps</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class=\"GfgPostLayout_quizComponentContainer__Zla_Q\"><div class=\"GfgPostLayout_quizComponentContainer_content__WzdAa\"><div id=\"LeftBarOutsideIndia_sidebar_OI__n_7R4\" class=\"sidebar_wrapper\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x250_chained_1\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x250_chained_2\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x250_chained_3\"></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\" id=\"GFG_AD_Leftsidebar_300x600_chained_1\"></div></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCardsCollection_article--viewer__iYKAo article--viewer\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCardsCollection_mainContentContainer__Uu0fa\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCardsCollection_mainContentContainer_innerContentContainer__qyLK3\"><div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__UXkgY\"><header class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__quizHeader__N_1lx\"><h1 class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__quizHeader__titleHeading__lhMiT\">SQL</h1></header><div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__rERyi\"><div><div class=\"QuizUpdationStatus_lastUpdationDateConainer__bmecR\" style=\"font-size:15px\">Last Updated : </div></div><div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__commentOuterDiv__SrSrZ\">Discuss<div class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__commentOuterDiv__comment__X8RTI\"><span class=\"QuizHeader_quizHeaderContainer__updationStatusComment__commentOuterDiv__comment__commentTooltiptext__E_zol\" style=\"opacity:0\">Comments</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->1</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Table A:</strong></b></p><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-3.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2026-02-24-153509\" width=\"inherit\" height=\"inherit\" loading=\"auto\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Table B:</strong></b></p><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-4.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2026-02-24-153536\" width=\"inherit\" height=\"inherit\" loading=\"auto\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong> Table C:</strong></b></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-5.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2026-02-24-153933\" width=\"426\" height=\"92\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224153838510412/Screenshot-2026-02-24-153933.png 426w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224153838510412/Screenshot-2026-02-24-153933-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224153838510412/Screenshot-2026-02-24-153933-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224153838510412/Screenshot-2026-02-24-153933-300.png 300w\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the above tables A, B and C. How many tuples does the result of the following SQL query contains? </span></p><pre><span>SELECT A.id \nFROM   A \nWHERE  A.age &gt; ALL (SELECT B.age \n                    FROM   B \n                    WHERE  B. name = \"arun\") \n</span></pre></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>4</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>3</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>0</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>1</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->2</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A table </span><code><span>T(X, Y)</span></code><span> initially has one record </span><code><span>(1, 1)</span></code><span>. New records are inserted 128 times with:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>X = MX + 1,   Y = 2*MY + 1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>where </span><code><span>MX</span></code><span> and </span><code><span>MY</span></code><span> are the current maximums of X and Y.What will </span><code><span>MAX(X)</span></code><span> and </span><code><span>MAX(Y)</span></code><span> be after all insertions?</span></p><pre><span>SELECT Y FROM T WHERE X=7;</span></pre></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>127</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>255</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>129</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>257</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->3</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Database table by name Loan_Records is given below. </span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-6.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2026-02-24-161349\" width=\"435\" height=\"123\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224161228625457/Screenshot-2026-02-24-161349.png 435w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224161228625457/Screenshot-2026-02-24-161349-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224161228625457/Screenshot-2026-02-24-161349-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224161228625457/Screenshot-2026-02-24-161349-300.png 300w\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> What is the output of the following SQL query? </span></p><pre><span>SELECT Count(*) \nFROM  ( ( SELECT Borrower, Bank_Manager \n          FROM Loan_Records) AS S \n          NATURAL JOIN ( SELECT Bank_Manager, Loan_Amount \n                         FROM Loan_Records) AS T );</span></pre></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>3</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>9</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>5</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>6</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->4</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A relational schema for a train reservation database is given below. Passenger (pid, pname, age) Reservation (pid, class, tid)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Table: Passenger</strong></b></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-7.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2026-02-24-164256\" width=\"427\" height=\"154\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164147857288/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164256.png 427w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164147857288/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164256-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164147857288/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164256-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164147857288/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164256-300.png 300w\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Table : Reservation</strong></b></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-8.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2026-02-24-164523\" width=\"428\" height=\"206\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164537795694/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164523.png 428w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164537795694/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164523-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164537795694/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164523-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260224164537795694/Screenshot-2026-02-24-164523-300.png 300w\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p><span>\n</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> What pids are returned by the following SQL query for the above instance of the tables? </span></p><pre><span>SLECT pid\nFROM Reservation ,\nWHERE class ‘AC’ AND\n    EXISTS (SELECT *\n       FROM Passenger\n       WHERE age &gt; 65 AND\n       Passenger. pid = Reservation.pid)</span></pre></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>1, 0</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>1, 2</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>1, 3</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>1, 5</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->5</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let R and S be relational schemes such that R={a,b,c} and S={c}. Now consider&nbsp;the following queries on the database: </span></p><img src=\"./images/sql-132-img-9.png\" alt=\"gateqa\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\" loading=\"auto\"><pre><span>IV) SELECT R.a, R.b</span><br><span>       FROM R,S</span><br><span>            WHERE R.c=S.c</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> Which of the above queries are equivalent?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I and II</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I and III</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>II and IV</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> III and IV</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->6</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following relational schema:&nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p><pre><b><strong>Suppliers(</strong></b><u><b><strong class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textUnderline\">sid:integer, sname:string, city:string, street:string)</strong></b></u><br><u><b><strong class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textUnderline\">Parts(pid:integer, pname:string, color:string)</strong></b></u><br><u><b><strong class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textUnderline\">Catalog(sid:integer, pid:integer, cost:real)</strong></b></u></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>Consider the following relational query on the above database:&nbsp;</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p><pre><span>SELECT S.sname</span><br><span>    FROM Suppliers S</span><br><span>        WHERE S.sid NOT IN (SELECT C.sid</span><br><span>                            FROM Catalog C</span><br><span>                            WH